# Judge10-2-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Head1,ArmR5_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Uncomfortable_Open1,Mouth1_Fearful_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我承认，我……<br>原本是人类……|#0205Trial02_Meruru001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Head1,ArmR3_1,ArmL3,Eyes1_Pensive_Open1,Mouth1_Angry_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:但是我生活在这座岛上，<br>并且得到了<br>大魔女大人的认可……！|#0205Trial02_Meruru002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Head1,ArmR5_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Cry_Closed2,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:大魔女大人<br>担心我的安危，<br>为了让我能保护自己，<br>于是赐予了我<br>魔法……|#0205Trial02_Meruru003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; ＠備考◆喜び

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Head1,ArmR5_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Pensive_Open1,Mouth1_Smile_Closed1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"之后我成为了魔女，<br>成为了<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_02_01\">大魔女大人的家人</link>！|#0205Trial02_Meruru004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Head1,ArmR8_1,ArmL8,Eyes1_Downcast_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……那之后，大魔女大人她<br>向世界散布了诅咒。|#0205Trial02_Meruru005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Head1,ArmR1_1,ArmL1,Eyes1_Downcast_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"为了让人类们<br>永远互相争斗……<br>对他们<link=\"Objection_02_05_02_02\">移植</link>了<br>自身的魔女因子。|#0205Trial02_Meruru006|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Head1,ArmR1_1,ArmL1,Eyes1_Cry_Closed2,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:实在是……太可怜了。<br>她走后只剩我一个人……<br>我感到很孤独……|#0205Trial02_Meruru007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Normal1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:但是大魔女大人<br>在即将消失前，<br>给我留下了遗言……<br>她说<br>【要将自身转化为魔女因子】……|#0205Trial02_Meruru008| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:65,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Head1,ArmR1_1,ArmL1,Eyes1_Cry_Closed2,Mouth1_Angry_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"所以我认为……<br>大魔女大人她化作了魔女因子，<br><br><link=\"Objection_02_05_02_03\">藏匿</link>在人类之中……<br>所以我<br>现在也一直在找她。|#0205Trial02_Meruru009|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

