[PrintTextModified Text:大魔女的同胞被赶尽杀绝，<br>她发誓要向人类复仇。|#0205Trial02_Hiro025| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.8
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:……而复仇的方法，就是把人类变成怪物。|#0205Trial02_Hiro026| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:将他们变成【操纵魔法且无恶不作的异形】……<br>也就是，变成想像中的【魔女】形象。|#0205Trial02_Hiro027| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.7
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:这种咒术，就是【魔女因子】。|#0205Trial02_Hiro028| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.21
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:不觉得它简直就像改写人类基因的病毒一样……<br>跟生物武器一样棘手吗。|#0205Trial02_Hiro029| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:而大魔女为了测试其效果，<br>将某个少女当作了实验体。|#0205Trial02_Hiro030| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

