@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:不、不对……！不是这样的……！|#0205Trial02_Meruru023| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Head2,ArmR4_2,ArmL13,Eyes2_Angry_Closed1,Mouth2_Surprised_Open1,Sweat2_1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:因为，大魔女大人……说我是【家人】……！<br>她是……这么说的……！|#0205Trial02_Meruru024| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:CreatureHiro.11
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hiro Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:……如果真的把你当作家人来爱，<br>那她怎么会把你用作屠杀人类的诅咒的实验体呢？|#0205Trial02_Hiro034| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Head2,ArmR4_2,ArmL3,Eyes2_Angry_Closed1,Mouth2_Angry_Open1,Sweat2_1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Right
